      "content": "That's a good start, but let's get a bit more specific with the prose. I want to make sure the reader really feels the weight of how much the opposition is lacking in empathy. Can you rewrite that to specifically emphasize how their political stance makes them almost incapable of recognizing moral nuance? I want to drive home the idea that their ideology is essentially a barrier to human connection.",
